{"id":"658396","name":"凉拌菠菜金针菇","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658396/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"1小把"},{"name":"金针菇干","amount":"50g"},{"name":"炒花生米","amount":"30g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"10g"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"辣椒粉","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"金针菇干。","img":"images/658396/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"浸泡五分钟后清洗干净，沥干水分。","img":"images/658396/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"菠菜清洗干净。","img":"images/658396/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切成两段。","img":"images/658396/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备炒花生米、蒜末、小米椒、辣椒粉。","img":"images/658396/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜碗中呛入热油，激发香气。","img":"images/658396/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入酱油、陈醋、糖拌匀，凉拌汁就调好了。","img":"images/658396/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里水烧开，放入金针菇焯水一分钟。","img":"images/658396/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捞出装盘。","img":"images/658396/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"水里加入油和盐，放入菠菜焯水30秒。","img":"images/658396/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/658396/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入凉拌汁。","img":"images/658396/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入花生米拌匀。","img":"images/658396/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658396/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}